 m_aMissionDescriptors {
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250503DF684C0}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "June 6th, 1944 the 101st and 82nd Airborne embarked onto a journey into Western Europe in order to conduct raids onto rearward german troops, secure vital causeways and facilitate a rapid breakthrough into the Cotentin Pennisula. 101st, 501st, Dog Company has been tasked with dropping in and securing the German HQ in the castle outside of La Rue. aerial recon has reported this as stilll active as of June 1st. Rearward German units have rapidly scrambled a defense mounting a forward screen to catch incoming American troops. SS and Wehrmacht alike have ended up in foxholes together."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Composition: Infantry"\
